OL,3,GNEWSASenior police officer denies sex
OL,4,Aassault charge
OL,5,
OL,6,FA senior Devon and Cornwall Police
OL,7,Fofficer has denied sexually assaulting
OL,8,Fa woman.
OL,10,FTemporary Supt Robert James Saunders,
OL,11,Fknown as Jim, from Bodmin, appeared in
OL,12,FPlymouth Magistrates' Court.
OL,14,FThe 48-year-old spoke only to confirm
OL,15,Fhis name, date of birth, address and
OL,16,Fenter his not guilty plea.
