OL,3,GNEWSASenior police officer denies sex
OL,4,Aassault charge
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe charge alleged on 10 June 2022 in
OL,7,FExeter he "intentionally touched a
OL,8,Fwoman aged 16 or over and that touching
OL,9,Fwas sexual when she did not consent and
OL,10,Fyou did not reasonably believe that she
OL,11,Fwas consenting".
